# Local dependencies and outputs must never replace clean container builds.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/*.log

# Credentials, repository metadata, and local tooling are not build inputs.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.git
.github
.agents
.codex
.aws
.azure
.heroui-docs
.idea
.vscode
docs
